#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:1384
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"This deletes the photos, videos, stickers and files {account} downloaded to "
"this computer. Messages stay, and attachments download again when you open "
"them, while WhatsApp still has them."
msgstr ""
"Se eliminarán las fotos, los vídeos, los stickers y los archivos que "
